'''Melody''' is an [[NPC]] found in {{Zone|Melody's Plateau}} of the {{Zone|Savanna Woodland}}. She allows the player to play multiple songs on the [[Harp]] after repairing it with {{Item|Acacia Log|amount=512}}s. Repairing it also rewards the player with {{Item|Melody's Shoes}}, {{C|2,000}}, {{Skill XP|1,500 Foraging}}, and {{SkyBlock XP|+5}}.

Upon completing a song, '''Melody''' can reward the player with {{SkyBlock XP}}, {{Stat|Int}}, and {{Item|Melody's Hair}}. The player can also purchase a {{Item|Personal Harp}} from her.

