== Tips ==
* Pressing {{Abbr|drop item|Default keybind: q}} instead of just clicking can help prevent high latency from causing rapid clicks to not be counted.
* By binding middle click to left or right mouse button (whichever you prefer) blocks will never be picked up when clicking, making missing clicks due to holding a block no longer a problem.

== Trivia ==
* Clicking when there is no note active will reduce your score even if you otherwise perfectly hit all notes.
* In total, the rewards are a permanent upgrade of {{Stat|int|+26}}, {{SkyBlock XP|+140}}, and the [[Melody's Hair]] accessory.<!--
** Through the Campfire and Pachelbel can only be accessed with the Personal Harp and give a reward of +1 {{Stat|int}} upon completion, making the Personal Harp reward a total of 28 {{Stat|int}} by completing all songs.-->

